Always use latest tailwind documentation

Before adding some styling check the src/index.css file, the you should find available variables
Pay attention that in the latest tailwindcss documentation use can specify variables like
`
@theme {
  --font-poppins: Poppins, sans-serif;
}
`
and then use it like className="font-poppins"
All other similar variables you can find in latest tailwindcss doc
always use them if any available and only in case not then use custom inline

if you see something like bg-[var(--color-purple-gem)] or bg-[--color-purple-gem] rewrite it to be bg-purle-gem, it should be used always from config first